// A 2.5-axis program of three tools: a pocket round an island cleared in raster passes, a bore and four drilled holes.
//
// Refused: popkern has no sweep of a solid, so it cannot take a plate less everything a cutter
// passes through along a CAM program; each move's envelope would have to be built by hand.
throw "popkern has no sweep of a solid: a cutter run along a program is not a feature it has";
